baseball team begins its new season with new members including Ichiban and Ryo.\n\nThe Eastern Tokyo block preliminaries begin for the summer national tournament, and the Meisei High School team advances steadily. Memories of past summers are recalled as the team confronts formidable opponents Kenjo, Seinan, and Eishin, striving to finally win the coveted slot in the national tournament. Along the way, various human relationships and emotions intersect, and a key character in TOUCH  also joins the scene.\n\n(Source: ytv)"},"tags":[{"name":"Baseball","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"School","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"MIX MEISEI STORY Season2","english":"MIX MEISEI STORY Season2","native":"MIX MEISEI STORY 2ND SEASON ～二度目の夏、空の向こうへ～","romaji":"MIX: MEISEI STORY 2ND SEASON  - Nidome no Natsu, Sora no Mukou e","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"MIX：明青故事 第二季 ～第二个夏天，迈向晴空～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"萌百译名|MIX 2ND SEASON ～第二次的夏天，向着天空～"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"壁吧译名|MIX：明青故事 第二季 ～第二次的夏天，向着天空的另一方～"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}